Start with [Getting started]($link.page('docs/getting-started')), then build a complete app in the [tutorial]($link.page('docs/tutorial')).

Already have a website? [Wrap a web app]($link.page('docs/wrap')) with
`oriel wrap` to give it a desktop window, tray icon and Linux AppImage.

For mobile apps, see [Android and iOS]($link.page('docs/mobile')). Add native
Android behavior and SDK integrations with
[app-owned Android extensions]($link.page('docs/android-extensions')).

# Capabilities and local AI

- [Modules and plugins]($link.page('docs/modules')): tray, updater, dialogs, notifications, shortcuts, clipboard, SQLite, deep links, and network mDNS.
- [Offline text to speech]($link.page('docs/tts')): `oriel.tts` with Kokoro-82M voices, verified downloads, and streaming playback on CPU or GPU.
- [Android and iOS]($link.page('docs/mobile')): camera, microphone, SAF, and mobile-specific modules.
